                                               "underTheHood":  "Rendering work depends on document structure, computed styles and layout requirements. Browsers may optimize or skip some stages for particular changes.",
                                               "interviewAnswer":  "Browsers parse HTML and CSS, construct the relevant document and style structures, calculate layout, paint visual content and composite the resulting layers for display.",
